          Understanding Your Thyroid Test Report: TSH, T3, T4 Explained Simply
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Thyroid disorders affect an estimated 42 million people in India. If your doctor ordered a thyroid panel, here is exactly what each value means — in plain language.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4 mt-6 text-xs text-muted font-mono">
          <span>📅 Oct 25, 2026</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>⏱ 7 min read</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>✅ Doctor-Reviewed</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

